{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1386397-oppertunities-for-beats","id":1386397,"title":"Oppertunities for Beats","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-07T07:49:08-07:00","id":1386397,"title":"Oppertunities for Beats","content":"I am currently STing a game with both a Vampire player and a Werewolf player.<br /> <br /> The Vampire is humanity nine, meaning lots of things are sources of detachment and his strong resolve and composure means that he has resisted falling down to lower rungs. As a result, he is gaining beats at a considerably faster pace than the Werewolf.<br /> <br /> She is currently Harmony 9, and I presumed would likewise be compelled to move towards Harmony Five but I've not found it comes up often. I think this might just be that I've been a fan of Vampire for longer.<br /> <br /> Can I get some example stressors towards spirit for Werewolves that might afflict a newly-changed (but non-teen) ghost wolf? Any advice for keeping beat-rates similar, or am I over-reacting to a one-off situation for the vampire?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2003-tabanese","name":"Tabanese","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2003_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"282"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-07T08:16:50-07:00","id":1386407,"title":"","content":"I should first point out that Harmony doesn't give you Beats for testing it.<br /> <br /> That said, two of the big things for werewolves getting Beats are the Siskur-Dah and the extra Aspirations they get from belonging to packs and lodges.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-07T08:56:13-07:00","id":1386417,"title":"","content":"So being a new wolf without a pack, and still unfamiliar with the Spirit world means a slower start. Okay. At least I'm not playing it 'wrong' per se.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2003-tabanese","name":"Tabanese","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2003_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"282"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-07T09:20:24-07:00","id":1386418,"title":"","content":"Another angle is the Condition(s) you get for flaring your Renown, but that's a bit sparser, especially early on.<br /> <br /> There's also Bans from certain rites and dramatic failure results on a few Gifts, but that leans into particulars.<br /> <br /> In general, unless you're angling to spend a long time in the Shadow on the regular, your best bet for shifting Harmony towards Spirit is to kill and/or eat a lot of people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}